<title>USA: Heist sees Ablest spinoff by fiscal year-end.</title>
<headline>Heist sees Ablest spinoff by fiscal year-end.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>C.H. Heist Corp said it expects to complete the spin-off and initial public offering of Ablest Service Corp, its temporary staffing unit, by the end of the current fiscal year.</p>
<p>C.H. Heist said it received a favorable ruling from the U.S. Internal Revenue Service to distribute Ablest's common stock to its shareholders.</p>
<p>Ablest, which specializes in supplying clerical workers and workers for light industries, has 30 offices in the Midwestern and Southeastern United States.</p>
<p>C.H. Heist provides cleaning, insulation, and maintenance services in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
